  "description": "PIBPEY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H92 Gd4 N12 O16 S6. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.605-3.860 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.04-111.07°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C124H92Gd4N12O16S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
